      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SPLASH OF PAYNT (2) was responsible for a very good effort last time over 1800m at this track, finishing second and just 1.5 metres from the winner. Has the benefit of a good draw. Beautifully placed and is sure to play a major role. ART REGAL (6) resumes from a spell of nine weeks after closing off last campaign in good form, scoring at his last appearance over 2230m here. Generally comes to hand very quickly, with two wins from four first-up appearances. Sure to prove hard to beat on his return. MAGIC STORM (8) has been thereabouts of late and is a great chance to break through. Good effort last time out when she finished third at Port Pirie over 2050m. Top-three aspirations. LINXX (1) disappointed last time but is a chance based on a good third over 1800m at this circuit two runs back. Include from the coveted pegs draw.",
